WEBVTT

00:04:28.765 --> 00:04:30.994
tunaweza kuanza kuona
bidhaa kwenye soko

00:04:31.018 --> 00:04:34.884
zinazofanya kazi na mfumo wa ulinzi 
mwilini kusaidia kutengeneza upya,

00:04:34.908 --> 00:04:38.963
na labda siku moja tutaweza 
kua sambamba na salamander.

00:04:39.876 --> 00:04:41.027
Asante.

00:04:41.051 --> 00:04:44.690
(Makofi)